      "item": [
        {
          "id": "30d9b57b-5a88-4d6a-a665-7970cef5a2a3",
          "name": "Project a depth-bounded Context Graph rooted at an entity",
          "request": {
            "name": "Project a depth-bounded Context Graph rooted at an entity",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a generic node/edge projection of business and operational context rooted at the entity identified by (view, id). Supported views: `service` (rooted at a BusinessService), `ai_system` (rooted at an AI system), `decision_surface` (rooted at a surface).\nNode kinds: business_service, related_business_service, capability, process, decision_surface, ai_system, ai_system_binding, authority_summary, coverage.\nEdge kinds (all directed): relates_to, has_capability, has_process, has_surface, bound_to (ai_system_binding to most-specific scope), system_of (ai_system_binding to ai_system), summarises, reports_coverage.\nThe `depth` parameter is interpreted as undirected BFS hops from the root. Default is 3; values above 5 are silently clamped to 5. Per-entity authority detail (authority_profile, authority_grant, agent, fail_mode_policy) is intentionally absent from the Context Graph and will be first-class on the future /v1/graphs/authority endpoint.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "graphs",
                "context"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "view",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Perspective. `service` is rooted at a business service. `ai_system` is rooted at an AI system and walks bindings to their scope targets. `decision_surface` is rooted at a surface and emits parent process / business service plus AI systems bound directly to the surface.\n"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Root entity id. For view=service this is the business_service id.\n"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "depth",
                  "value": "3",
                  "description": "Maximum BFS hops from the root, treating edges as undirected. Values above 5 are silently clamped to 5; negative or non-numeric values return 400.\n"
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
          },
          "response": [
