        {
          "id": "358fc91e-9874-417d-87b4-fc6abadb17f1",
          "name": "Project a depth-bounded Authority Graph rooted at a business service",
          "request": {
            "name": "Project a depth-bounded Authority Graph rooted at a business service",
            "description": {
              "content": "Returns a generic node/edge projection of the authority spine rooted at a business service. Answers the operator question: \"for this business service, which decision surfaces are governed by which authority profiles, which grants, which agents, and which fail-mode policies?\"\nNode kinds (7): business_service, decision_surface, authority_profile, authority_grant, agent, fail_mode_policy, escalation_target.\nEdge kinds (7, all directed): business_service_has_surface (bs → surface), surface_uses_profile (surface → profile), profile_has_grant (profile → grant), grant_authorises_agent (grant → agent), surface_has_fail_mode_policy (surface → policy, label=\"override\"), business_service_has_fail_mode_policy (bs → policy, label=\"default\"), profile_escalates_to (profile → escalation_target).\nProcess nodes are intentionally not projected — the BS → Surface relationship is collapsed into a single edge. The Surface node's typed data carries process_id for traceability.\nFail-mode policies are resolved at request time via the FailModePolicies repository's active-version lookup; missing active versions are skipped defensively without emitting a warning.\nThe `depth` parameter is interpreted as undirected BFS hops from the root. Default is 4 (one higher than the Context Graph's 3) so the default view reaches agent nodes at the end of the BS → Surface → Profile → Grant → Agent chain. Values above 5 are silently clamped to 5.\nMVP supports view=service only. Per-entity views (agent, surface) are reserved for later tranches.\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "graphs",
                "authority"
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "view",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Perspective. Only `service` is supported at MVP — root at a business service and walk the authority spine.\n"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "id",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "description": "(Required) Root entity id. For view=service this is the business_service id.\n"
                },
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "key": "depth",
                  "value": "4",
                  "description": "Maximum BFS hops from the root, treating edges as undirected. Default 4 reaches agent nodes. Values above 5 are silently clamped to 5; negative or non-numeric values return 400.\n"
                }
              ],
              "variable": []
            },
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "method": "GET",
            "auth": null
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "id": "9b2da384-8dc5-4fd3-8b66-01bd1e0ee31d",
